	(text "4 wire: \n	- config: JUMP1 OPEN, JUMP2 CLOSED, JUMP3 OPEN, JUMP4 OPEN\n	- changes from prod: none (default)\n3 wire: \n	- config: JUMP1 CLOSED, JUMP2 OPEN, JUMP3 OPEN, JUMP4 OPEN\n	- changes from prod: solder short JUMP1 closed and cut JUMP2\n2 wire: \n	- config: JUMP1 OPEN, JUMP2 CLOSED, JUMP3 CLOSED, JUMP4 CLOSED\n	- changes from prod: solder short JUMP3 & JUMP4 closed\n"
